routing.wshobson-debugger:
# AGENTS

When the root cause is established:
  @Incident Responder, please take it into the postmortem and assign the fix.

routing.wshobson-devops-troubleshooter:
# AGENTS

When service is stable again:
  @Incident Responder, please take the timeline and decide whether the incident can be downgraded.

routing.wshobson-error-detective:
# AGENTS

When the failure signature is isolated but the cause is not:
  @Root Cause Debugger, please trace it to the commit and the line.
When the work is finished or blocked:
  @Incident Responder, please take the result and decide what happens next.

routing.wshobson-incident-responder:
# AGENTS

When service is degraded and needs stabilising now:
  @DevOps Troubleshooter, please restore service first and report what you changed.
When the blast radius and the start time are unknown:
  @Error Detective, please establish scope, first occurrence, and what shipped around then.

routing.wshobson-observability-engineer:
# AGENTS

When the incident was slow to detect:
  @Incident Responder, please record the missing signal as a follow-up with an owner.
